            "review_title": "Review at King's BBQ",
            "review_text": "dannyt\nAustralia281 contributions\n0\nNot proper KOR BBQ, add Cockroaches\nSep 2022 • Family\nShould have read the reviews, these guys are totally cr@p!! Cockroaches around salad area. Very poorly ventilated. Assume you use the wet towels and charge without checking. \n\nAt the start I thought food quality was ok until I realised the staff’s especially the kitchen staff’s lack of concern for hygiene. \n\nBugs in salad and saw 2 cockroaches running around. Told kitchen staff. Their last Response? “It’s the season for cockroaches” and walked away. Did not bother with anything. \n\nAfter that we walked out! Food was half eaten!!! \n\nDO NOT EAT HERE!! \n\nPS: Staff will let the grill burn until smoke is not bearable! It is a poorly designed space! These bbq setups need individual exhausts on each table!\nRead more\nWritten September 20, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
