            "review_text": "Italia1170\nBrooklyn, New York15 contributions\n0\nI'm not a Korean BBQ expert\nMar 2020\nThis is the best value play in the city.\n\nI got the low end BBQ package and it cost 199,000 dong.\n\nThis included 17 different meat choices cooked by an employee at the table-and as much of any type of meat as desired.\n\nThe had many choices from fruits, to salads, to soups, to desserts on the salad bar.\n\nThe meats were very good quality and I will definitely be back.\n\nAgain, this is the best value play I have come across in the last 6 weeks I have been in Nha Trang\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 11, 2020",
