            "review_text": "Du_Ma\nNha Trang, Vietnam90 contributions\n0\nIncredible what the media\nMar 2020\nIncredible what the media hype has done to restaurants and businesses in this city, country and everywhere else. \nLast night was my/ our first time here and it was a little scary because it looked like a scene out of the 70’s movie \nOmega Man. \nThere’s two or three big dining rooms and they were all empty. The escalators to the upper floor were even shut off..\n\nAnyway, we were finally seated and everything went just fine. There was only us and one other table in the joint. \n\nTypically you walk in to any Kings or Seoul Garden and the place is absolutely packed. Scores of Chinese screaming \nMot-hai-ba “Dzo” but recently its just \nCrickets. \n\nI hope things can quickly go back to the way they were before, it’s a really scary feeling and all caused by media Hysteria.\nRead more\nWritten March 2, 2020",
