            "review_title": "Review at King's BBQ",
            "review_text": "tieu112\nNha Trang, Vietnam104 contributions\n0\nThe worst BBQ experience\nApr 2019 • Couples\nFirst the complimentary side dishes were shameful, and 5 side dishes is an insult to Korean BBQ. The deep fried lotus root was inedible, almost broke my tooth biting into it. It was so hard and stale that it should be banned. The morning glory spinach was bland and the dish with pork and quail eggs was just disgusting. The kim chi was the only thing edible.\n\nThe bimbimbap was the worst I've ever had. The rice was so moist and so bland I thought I was eating congee. Salted congee would have tasted better than this.\n\nThe boneless prime beef was fine except that we asked not to be overcooked, I had to take over the cooking so that the beef didn't turn into a well done piece of rubber. The marinated pork belly was ok.\n\nWe've eaten at King BBQ in Saigon and it was much much better than this. This place needs to retrain the cooks because anybody who eats Korean BBQ is gonna be very disappointed.\nRead more\nWritten April 14, 2019",
