            "review_text": "DrBillHCMC\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam86 contributions\n0\nSURPRISED not reviewed before!\nAug 2017 • Solo\nNot sure why this restaurant has not been reviewed before, but it needs to be listed, reviewed, and most importantly: ENJOYED!\nThe food is fresh and excellent, the staff is excellent, friendly, and attentive. I had the all-you-can-eat buffet for a great price. And they don't fill the offerings with a lot of fillers. Whether its seafood, beef, chicken, pork, or vegetarian, they have it all. And I had most of all. This is a must try restaurant if you are in Nha Trang, especially if you have a hearty appetite. Hope this helps and don't forget to add reviews from your experience. Enjoy!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 31, 2017",
